      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Radiophobia 3 is a fan-created modification for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. games, developed and wholly owned by GSC Game World. Radiophobia 3 is not an official product of GSC Game World and is a derivative work based on their S.T.A.L.K.E.R. games. \\n \\n You can buy the original games here:",
